      <activity id="3ddfb8e4-025d-5407-9718-16b532fcbf3d" activityNameId="d562d551-a4b8-5ac5-b27a-de9f25f6b102" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal of heating system, apartment building Ecofaubourg A</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal of heating system, apartment building Ecofaubourg A
Disposal of components for the heating system;
UUID: 08cfeb0a-d245-463b-a693-75c0067f95ce
Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in sorting plants in Switzerland.
Technology: Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Metal pieces, copper in cables and electronic devices are recycled, plastic parts are incinerated, inert wastes are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Waste-specific calculation based on input data from call of bids for a heating system of a specific building. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_08cfeb0a-d245-463b-a693-75c0067f95ce.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
